#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Maîtres commerçants"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "Les Carthaginois étaient largement connus pour leur vaste commerce à travers la mer Méditerranée."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Les navires de commerce sont disponibles dans la phase village."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Économie minière"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "L’économie carthaginoise était centrée autour de l’exploitation minière, la pierre constituant une grande partie des structures de Carthage."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "Les technologies de minage de pierre sont gratuites et instantanées."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Cavalerie numide"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "Les chevaux de la cavalerie Numide, ancêtres du cheval Berbère, étaient petits par rapport aux autres chevaux de l’époque et bien adaptés pour se déplacer plus rapidement sur de longues distances."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "Javelineurs de cavalerie +10% de vitesse de marche."

